    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "look i know you aren't a doctor but im just trying to figure out the math here. if there's 120g of carbs and my ratio is usually 1:10, then logically 12 units should cover it, right? but i'm feeling kinda lightheaded and high at the same time so i thought maybe i needed more to compensate. if i do 15 or 20 units will that be okay to bring it down quickly? i dont want to call the doc at this hour if i can just fix it myself",
